    "Description": "A transparency slide showing the left side of a carousel pig. The pig is colored a reddish orange and a light tan. The tack is green, red, and yellow. The saddle is brown and has a lighter colored saddle blanket. The pig appears to be extremely worn. The image has small dark spots on it. The slide has typed at the top “PULLEN PARK CAROUSEL PULLEN PARK” and written “16A left”. At the bottom is written “Pig” and typed “RALEIGH NC WAKE CO RR RALEIGH FINE ARTS SOCIETY”. There is a second line stamped in red over the “RALEIGH NC” at the bottom that reads “JUN79A”.",
